{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2021-12-10 09:42:00', 'title': 'ENERGY SECRETARY JENNIFER M. GRANHOLM HIGHLIGHTS CLEAN ENERGY INVESTMENTS ON TOUR OF EXELON NUCLEAR PLANT', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXELON CORP. (NASDAQ: EXC) HOSTED U.S. SECRETARY OF ENERGY JENNIFER M. GRANHOLM ON A TOUR OF EXELON'S BRAIDWOOD GENERATING STATION IN WILL COUNTY TO HIGHLIGHT THE ECONOMIC AND ENVIRONMENTAL BENEFITS OF INVESTING IN CLEAN ENERGY TO ADDRESS THE CLIMATE CRISIS, SUPPORT AND GROW GOOD-PAYING JOBS AND SECURE AMERICA'S LEADERSHIP IN A CLEAN ENERGY FUTURE. THE VISIT COMES AS FEDERAL LAWMAKERS ARE CONSIDERING SWEEPING CLIMATE LEGISLATION AS PART OF PRESIDENT BIDEN'S BUILD BACK"}